## Claude Code specifics

- **End-of-turn hooks, no edit hook.** Nothing formats files after Edit/Write. `Stop` and
  `UserPromptSubmit` run `scripts/after_turn.py` (AGENTS.md, Commands): formatting, generators and
  readiness only. They are silent to the model, never block a prompt and fix nothing else;
  `just hygiene` findings (type errors, lint) are the agent's at scope end. Subagents stopping
  don't trigger the hooks.
{% if with_python -%}
- **Diagnostics:** the pyright plugin is disabled for this project (`.claude/settings.json`)
  because pyrefly is the type checker. There is no in-session Python language server; Python
  diagnostics come from `just types`, part of `just hygiene` at scope end.
{% endif -%}
- **Subagents:** [shared roles](.agents/roles/README.md) define responsibility and handoff;
  `.claude/agents/` supplies native model/tool configuration. `implementer` uses the executor
  contract. Use fresh context for independent review; the binding selects formal tier and purpose.
- **Memory:** project memory records preferences that are not yet written down here; the
  repository binding under ADR-0002 owns review mechanics; AGENTS.md owns agent instructions.
